        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ryan Tedder, Leona Lewis, Jennifer Lopez, Simon Cowell\n- Organizations: OneRepublic, Syco Music, The X Factor\n- Songs: Do It Well\n- Roles: songwriter, producer, lead vocalist\n\nFacts:\n- In 2006, Leona Lewis won the third series of The X Factor and received a £1 million recording contract with Syco Music, Simon Cowell's record label.\n- Ryan Tedder is the lead vocalist of the pop rock band OneRepublic.\n- Ryan Tedder has an independent career as a songwriter and producer for artists including Madonna, U2, Adele, Beyoncé, Maroon 5, Demi Lovato, Ariana Grande, Kelly Clarkson, Jennifer Lopez, Westlife, Ed Sheeran, One Direction, Big Time Rush, Camila Cabello, Taylor Swift, Leona Lewis, Zedd, and MØ.\n- Do It Well was written by Ryan Tedder, Leonard Caston, Anita Poree, and Frank Wilson.",
